        'Return window decision: the owner decides whether to publish a return window on the returns page (for example 14 days). Until one is published, no returns data is added to the structured data, because it must match what the customer can read.',
        'Search Console and Bing: if the Wix site had a Search Console property, export its last 16 months of performance data first, as the baseline for judging whether rankings carried over (it is lost when Wix is cancelled). After launch add a Domain property for saltylamps.co.uk verified by a DNS TXT record added without disturbing the Zoho mail records, submit https://www.saltylamps.co.uk/sitemap.xml, inspect and request indexing for the home page, one product and one category, then import the site into Bing Webmaster Tools.',
        'Watch search coverage weekly for eight weeks: pages indexed against the 108 addresses in the sitemaps, the redirect and 404 reports, and clicks and impressions against the Wix baseline. A dip in the first weeks is normal; a page that stays discovered but not indexed, or a growing 404 list, needs investigation.',
        'Cloudflare zone settings for speed and crawling: Always Use HTTPS on; HSTS with a short max-age first, raised only after a month without certificate or mixed-content problems; HTTP/3, Brotli and Early Hints on; Crawler Hints on so search engines learn when content changes; Web Analytics (free, no cookies) for real-visitor speed figures. Confirm the settings in the owner-account dashboard, since they cannot be read from here.',
